  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "驗票口的另一頭……<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9A57796853E3768453E64E00982D2026202600100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "驗票口的另一頭滿是\n人們與寶可夢耀眼的日常。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n來自遙遠地區的人看到密阿雷的城市風貌，\n可是會感到驚訝的喔！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9A57796853E3768453E64E00982D6EFF662F000A4EBA501182075BF653EF59228000773C768465E55E38300200100001BE01000A4F8681EA905990605730534076844EBA770B52305BC6963F96F7768457CE5E0298A88C8CFF0C000A53EF662F6703611F52309A5A8A1D76845594FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好想來場寶可夢對戰！<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D60F34F8658345BF653EF59225C0D6230FF0100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好想在密阿雷市來一場\n緊張刺激的寶可夢對戰呢。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D60F357285BC6963F96F75E024F864E005834000A7DCA5F35523A6FC076845BF653EF59225C0D6230546230020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在密阿雷有很多咖啡館喔。\n爸爸他在選店時一定會猶豫不決的。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "57285BC6963F96F767095F88591A54965561992855943002000A723872384ED6572890785E9766424E005B9A670373368C6B4E0D6C7A768430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "到咖啡館休息一下好了。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "52305496556199284F11606F4E004E0B597D4E8630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "13個小時都坐在飛機上\n果然很累人……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00310033500B5C0F664290FD5750572898DB6A5F4E0A000A679C71365F887D2F4EBA202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真期待能遇見\n什麼樣的寶可夢呢！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F671F5F8580FD9047898B000A4EC09EBC6A2376845BF653EF59225462FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "密阿雷市的街道上\n也有野生的寶可夢喔。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BC6963F96F75E027684885790534E0A000A4E5F670991CE751F76845BF653EF5922559430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是密阿雷市耶！<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F5BC6963F96F75E028036FF0100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的旅行包好大啊。\n請好好享受在密阿雷的觀光之旅喔。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B3768465C5884C5305597D5927554A3002000A8ACB597D597D4EAB53D757285BC6963F96F7768489C051494E4B65C5559430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我打算要來調查最近\n在密阿雷市發生的變化。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621162537B9789814F868ABF67E567008FD1000A57285BC6963F96F75E02767C751F76848B8A531630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "密阿雷是一座兼具了\n歷史風情與挑戰精神的城市。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BC6963F96F7662F4E005EA7517C51774E86000A6B7753F298A860C58207631162307CBE795E768457CE5E0230020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我來了，密阿雷市！\n快熱烈歡迎我！<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114F864E86FF0C5BC6963F96F75E02FF01000A5FEB71B170C86B618FCE6211FF0100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "當然，為了讓自己能被歡迎，\n我也會打從心底享受密阿雷的！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75767136FF0C70BA4E868B9381EA5DF180FD88AB6B618FCEFF0C000A62114E5F670362535F9E5FC35E954EAB53D75BC6963F96F77684FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "把行李放在旅館之後\n就到街上散散步吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "628A884C674E653E572865C599284E4B5F8C000A5C31523088574E0A656365636B65542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這正是卡洛斯地區！<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90196B63662F53616D1B65AF57305340FF0100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "從車窗看出去的風景\n讓人覺得這正是卡洛斯地區！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F9E8ECA7A97770B51FA53BB768498A8666F000A8B934EBA89BA5F9790196B63662F53616D1B65AF57305340FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "從機場到密阿雷市\n意外有段距離呢。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F9E6A5F583452305BC6963F96F75E02000A610F591667096BB58DDD96E2546230020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只要有搭檔的寶可夢在身邊，\n一個人旅行這點事我也能辦到。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA89816709642D6A9476845BF653EF592257288EAB908AFF0C000A4E00500B4EBA65C5884C90199EDE4E8B62114E5F80FD8FA6523030020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "列車晃得我太舒服，\n讓我都睡著了。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "52178ECA66435F976211592A8212670DFF0C000A8B93621190FD776184574E8630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
